      "summary": "PodSecurityPolicy for the cert-manager webhook pods, disabling privileged mode and privilege escalation while restricting volumes, host access, and runAs/seccomp/AppArmor profiles.",
      "tags": ["configuration", "security", "pod-security-policy", "kubernetes", "helm-chart"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "Uses the deprecated policy/v1beta1 PSP API behind a Helm values flag; hostNetwork and securePort are driven by .Values.webhook."
    },
    {
