      "summary": "Bundles all webhook RBAC objects: a namespaced Role/RoleBinding for reading and updating dynamic serving-certificate Secrets and a ClusterRole/ClusterRoleBinding for creating SubjectAccessReviews.",
      "tags": ["configuration", "rbac", "security", "kubernetes", "helm-chart"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "Contains four documents in one file separated by '---', with resourceNames scoped to the CA Secret and conditional metrics-TLS Secret access."
